behavior endangers other users\n• We suspect fraudulent activity\n• We are required to do so by law\n\n9. Limitation of Liability\n\nKwanza-lova provides the service \"as is.\" We do not guarantee that the service will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.\n\nKwanza-lova is not responsible for interactions between users, whether online or offline. You are solely responsible for your interactions with other users.\n\nTo the fullest extent permitted by law, Kwanza-lova will not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages.\n\nOur total liability will not exceed the amount you have paid to Kwanza-lova in the preceding 12 months.\n\n10. Indemnification\n\nYou agree to indemnify and hold Kwanza-lova harmless from any and all claims arising out of or relating to your breach of these Terms or your use of the Service.\n\n11. Changes to Terms\n\nWe reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Modifications will be effective immediately upon posting on the application.\n\nYour continued use of the Service after the posting of modifications constitutes your acceptance of the new Terms.\n\n12. Governing Law and Jurisdiction\n\nThese Terms are governed by French law.\n\nAny dispute relating to these Terms will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Paris, France.\n\n13. Miscellaneous\n13.1 Entire Agreement\n\nThese Terms constitute the entire agreement between you and Kwanza-lova regarding your use of the Service.\n\n13.2 Severability\n\nIf any provision of these terms is deemed invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions will remain in full force and effect.\n\n13.3 Waiver\n\nThe failure to exercise any right under these terms does not constitute a waiver of that right.\n\n14. Contact\n\nFor any questions regarding these Terms of Use:\n\n• Email: legal@kwanza-lova.com\n• Support: support@kwanza-lova.com\n• Address: ...\n\nThank you for using Kwanza-lova. Together, let\'s create a respectful and caring community.',
